; Regression: the identical K0100 "expected `{`, found end of file" was reported twice at the
; end of the file, once for the unfinished `match` and once for the enclosing `if`, with K0101
; diagnostics in between. One gap gets one diagnostic (grammar.md §19.4).
(SourceFile
  (LayoutDecl layout y
    (MemberList
      (LoadingBlock loading (Block (IfExpr if (ParenExpr (MatchExpr match (ParenExpr)))))))))
